<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="container">
    <h1>WESKER LEGACY TIMELINE</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--terminal-white); margin-bottom: 2rem;">ALBERT WESKER // JAKE MULLER // UROBOROS</p>
    
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/timeline" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'INCIDENT TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">MAIN TIMELINE</a>
        <a href="/timeline/bsaa-corruption" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'BSAA CORRUPTION TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">BSAA CORRUPTION</a>
        <a href="/timeline/wesker-legacy" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'WESKER LEGACY TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">WESKER LEGACY</a>
        <a href="/timeline/umbrella" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'UMBRELLA RISE & FALL' ? 'active' : '' %>">UMBRELLA RISE & FALL</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1960s // PROJECT WESKER</div>
            <p>Albert Wesker created as part of Umbrella's Wesker Project. Enhanced abilities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1998 // STARS BETRAYAL</div>
            <p>Wesker betrays S.T.A.R.S. Fakes death in mansion incident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1998-2009 // GLOBAL OPERATIONS</div>
            <p>Wesker works for various organizations. Seeks Uroboros virus.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1980s // JAKE MULLER BORN</div>
            <p>Wesker's son, Jake Muller, born. Mother unknown. No contact with father.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2009 // WESKER'S DEATH</div>
            <p>Albert Wesker killed by Chris and Sheva in Africa. Uroboros fails.</p>
            <span class="threat-level HIGH">WESKER TERMINATED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2012-2013 // JAKE EMERGES</div>
            <p>Jake Muller discovered. Antibody blood can cure C-Virus.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2024 // WESKER LEGACY</div>
            <p>Jake active as mercenary. Wesker's bloodline continues. Under observation.</p>
            <span class="threat-level ACTIVE">ACTIVE</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(106, 13, 173, 0.2); border: 1px solid #6a0dad;">
        <h3 style="color: #6a0dad;">JAKE MULLER // SPECIAL STATUS</h3>
        <p>Subject exhibits enhanced strength and durability. Antibody blood valuable. Wesker lineage confirmed. Currently independent contractor.</p>
    </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>